{"annotationDigest":"sha256:6394aed487b769875aab9d4ea1aba244603ca43aaa8e42a31a0402c97607ae91","annotationId":"rann-87468eb4a2629880a717369d44fc4175","author":{"agent":"claude-code","kind":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5.5"},"createdAt":"2026-10-03T21:53:46Z","disclaimer":"AI-generated review opinion derived from the evidence package. It is not a verdict, does not change readiness, and must be confirmed by a human reviewer.","disclosureCheck":{"blocking":4,"contradictions":[],"disclosures":6,"nextDecision":"human_judgement","readiness":"not_assessed"},"findings":[{"claim":{"params":{"requirement":"SW-REQ-260922-SJ7P","via":"shell/plugins/menu/MenuModel.js:searchScore"},"type":"requirement_affected"},"detail":"MenuModel.js:377 changes the app bias from -5 to -100. Match tiers run 0-80, and menus/links get -2. So apps land at -100..-20 and every menu row at -2..80. The final key is score*1000 + depth*25 + order, so the gap of at least 18,000 points outweighs depth and order. SJ7P's description was rewritten on the mirror to state this (proof work: 76521985, 8456b2f0).","refs":[{"id":"shell/plugins/menu/MenuModel.js","kind":"file","line":377},{"id":"SW-REQ-260922-SJ7P","kind":"requirement"}],"severity":"info","title":"The ranking change is in searchScore, traced at function level to SW-REQ-260922-SJ7P","verification":{"evidence":[{"id":"SW-REQ-260922-SJ7P","kind":"requirement"}],"method":"review.changes (spec, code-trace, function and call-level requirement impact)","note":"SW-REQ-260922-SJ7P is in review.changes (modified, matchLevel function).","status":"confirmed"}},{"claim":{"params":{"requirement":"SW-REQ-260922-TKDP","via":"shell/plugins/menu/Menu.qml"},"type":"requirement_affected"},"detail":"Menu.qml:695-713 splits drilldown rows into appRows and deeperRows. It emits apps, then current-menu rows, then deeper rows (line 711), and derives searchDivider from the section marks (line 712). Menu.qml is a file-level unit (weak_mapping), so rebuildDisplay has no function-le